Implemented `scripts/m4a/output_assembly.py` (`assemble_corrected_md`, `assemble_diff_md`) and `scripts/m4a/residual_spans.py` (`build_residual_spans`), consuming the `diff_entries` structure from `merge_gate.py` without modifying it, per table-def §7.1/§7.4/§4.3 and M4A-BRIEF §3.6–§3.7. `screen` layer assignment is fail-closed rejected since M4-a runs before P3-b. No frame-extraction parameters were invented (OQ-M4-A left open).

